mode-1 / restart pieces), checked in `B0` … `B8` (`blkChk`) and glued by the witness table `W` (`glueChk`). It is replayed here
against the IP's own slot function `sl` (slots from the row-table entries). With `ipok` and `rows`, `E1GS.e1_sound`
gives `E1Concl Em 23`; `rowValid_of_e1` (padding, `oneOK`, `emOK`) then gives the class's row at `lbOf 696 = 24`.
`run_696 : Tab2.HighHyp 696 → RowValid (Tab2.basisOf 696) (Tab2.lbOf 696)` is the form `Tab2/Dispatch.lean` takes. -/

